{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《2026香港小姐競選決賽》昨日（30日）圓滿結束，3號李澄晴獲得友誼小姐。</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午2.35.56.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Py2UFfCxSl1788165576.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-31 下午2.35.56.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">完成賽事後友誼小姐李澄晴接受tvb.com獨家訪問滿意自己的表現，「因為我係第一次參加比賽，將所有嘅緊張都變成享受舞台。」 雖然李澄晴8強不入，惟她大方直言沒有不快，「因為個個佳麗都好優秀，覺得佢哋好值得入選。」她指現時最想大擦一餐，「咩都好想食。（之前戒咗口好耐？）都冇，大家都話我係零食大王。」又感謝大家辛苦照顧她們眾佳麗。</span><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"batch_FR6D5434.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026YvVWmgsJ0S1788165577.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"batch_FR6D5434.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T08:59:49.950441+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}